<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>God has made all things,</l><l>Made them perfectly—</l><l>What a wonderful creation</l><l>Everything we see.</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>God has made all things,</l><l>Made them perfectly—</l><l>What a wonderful Creator</l><l>In His work we see!</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
